[Graphics:Robot]
In the rooms the objects have no colours of their own: the whole screen is given the
colour of the room, which is different in each room. The sprites in these tables
that are not in the scenes at the end of the game are shown in bright white.

The robot is made of two sprites, one for the bottom half and one for the top half,
which are drawn one above the other.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
 { =h,c8 Bottom Walking West }
 { #N$10 | #SPRITE$10,attr=$47(robot-bottom-west-01-colour*) | #N$11 | #SPRITE$11,attr=$47(robot-bottom-west-02-colour*) | #N$12 | #SPRITE$12,attr=$47(robot-bottom-west-03-colour*) | #N$13 | #SPRITE$13,attr=$47(robot-bottom-west-02-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Bottom Walking East }
 { #N$14 | #SPRITE$14,attr=$47(robot-bottom-east-01-colour*) | #N$15 | #SPRITE$15,attr=$47(robot-bottom-east-02-colour*) | #N$16 | #SPRITE$16,attr=$47(robot-bottom-east-03-colour*) | #N$17 | #SPRITE$17,attr=$47(robot-bottom-east-02-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Bottom Turning }
 { #N$18 | #SPRITE$18,attr=$47(robot-bottom-turning-01-colour*) | #N$19 | #SPRITE$19,attr=$47(robot-bottom-turning-02-colour*) | #N$1A | #SPRITE$1A,attr=$47(robot-bottom-turning-03-colour*) | #N$1B | #SPRITE$1B,attr=$47(robot-bottom-turning-03-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Top Walking West }
 { #N$20 | #SPRITE$20,attr=$47(robot-top-west-01-colour*) | #N$21 | #SPRITE$21,attr=$47(robot-top-west-02-colour*) | #N$22 | #SPRITE$22,attr=$47(robot-top-west-03-colour*) | #N$23 | #SPRITE$23,attr=$47(robot-top-west-02-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Top Walking East }
 { #N$24 | #SPRITE$24,attr=$47(robot-top-east-01-colour*) | #N$25 | #SPRITE$25,attr=$47(robot-top-east-02-colour*) | #N$26 | #SPRITE$26,attr=$47(robot-top-east-03-colour*) | #N$27 | #SPRITE$27,attr=$47(robot-top-east-02-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Top Turning }
 { #N$28 | #SPRITE$28,attr=$47(robot-top-turning-01-colour*) | #N$29 | #SPRITE$29,attr=$47(robot-top-turning-02-colour*) | #N$2A | #SPRITE$2A,attr=$47(robot-top-turning-03-colour*) | #N$2B | #SPRITE$2B,attr=$47(robot-top-turning-03-colour*) }
