[Graphics:Game Scenes]
The objects in the scenes at the end of the game are coloured with the attributes
that are in the tables at #R$B82A and #R$B853. The alarm flashes between black and
the colour shown. The top and bottom halves of the robot when the game has been
completed turn bright white when it comes out of the oil.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
 { =h,c8 Game Over Robot }
 { #N$58 | #SPRITE$58,attr=$45(robot-arm-left-01-colour*) | #N$59 | #SPRITE$59,attr=$45(robot-arm-right-01-colour*) | #N$5A | #SPRITE$5A,attr=$45(robot-bottom-turning-02-colour*) | #N$5B | #SPRITE$5B,attr=$45(robot-top-turning-02-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Game Over Objects }
 { #N$50 | #SPRITE$50,attr=$46(alarm-01-colour*) | #N$51 | #SPRITE$51,attr=$42(boxing-glove-01-colour*) | #N$52 | #SPRITE$52,attr=$44(hammer-01-colour*) | #N$53 | #SPRITE$53,attr=$47(hook-01-colour*) }
 { =h,c8 Game Completed }
 { #N$55 | #SPRITE$55,attr=$44(pot-of-oil-01-colour*) | #N$5C | #SPRITE$5C,attr=$07(robot-bottom-turning-02-colour*) | #N$5D | #SPRITE$5D,attr=$07(robot-top-turning-02-colour*) }
UDGTABLE#

